Subject: [PATCH 15/15] Rebuild the 0.3.0 packages from the final tree

The documentation fix in the previous commit changes the sdist and crate
contents, so the three packages were rebuilt from it. The native extension
is byte-identical to the earlier build. The installed checks and the
release checks (tutorial and manual blocks, lean and matrix parity) were
rerun with the rebuilt wheel in a fresh CPython 3.12 environment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
